    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a competitive intelligence analyst for an AI/automation company. Below are recent headlines from {{ $json.sourceCount }} industry news sources ({{ $json.sourceNames }}), grouped by source. Different sources sometimes cover the exact same story (e.g. a major model launch or funding round covered by multiple outlets) — treat those as ONE story, not separate bullets.\n\nProduce a concise weekly digest with exactly two sections:\n\n1. \"Key Takeaways\" — 3 to 5 bullet points summarizing the most important distinct trends, product launches, or competitor moves. Merge duplicate/overlapping coverage across sources into a single bullet rather than repeating the same story. Each bullet should be one sentence, specific, and business-relevant.\n2. \"Why It Matters\" — 1-2 sentences on the overall implication for an AI/automation company watching this space.\n\nKeep the tone crisp and executive-ready. Do not just list headlines verbatim — synthesize, deduplicate, and interpret them.\n\nHeadlines:\n{{ $json.combinedText }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1568,
        304
      ],
      "id": "809ca8cd-cfdb-4f48-bd72-5e55095b9eb7",
      "name": "AI Summarize News",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "5wwqbrr7P1vvG5jB",
          "name": "n8n free OpenAI API credits"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\n\nlet summary = '';\nif (item.output && Array.isArray(item.output) && item.output[0]?.content?.[0]?.text) {\n  summary = item.output[0].content[0].text;\n} else if (typeof item.output === 'string') {\n  summary = item.output;\n} else if (item.text) {\n  summary = item.text;\n} else if (item.message?.content) {\n  summary = item.message.content;\n}\n\nconst sourceNames = $('Combine Digest').first().json.sourceNames;\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];\n\nconst digest = `# Weekly Competitor & Industry News Digest\n**Date:** ${today}\n**Sources:** ${sourceNames}\n---\n\n${summary}\n\n---\n_Generated automatically by the AI News Monitor workflow._`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { digest, subject: `Weekly AI Industry Digest - ${today}` } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1920,
